# SPA fallback for Cloudflare Pages / EdgeOne Pages:
# any path not matching a static file is rewritten to index.html (HTTP 200),
# so deep links like /store /comic /chat /settings /login boot the SPA directly.
# Existing static files (assets, spa.js, ...) take precedence over this rule.
# NOTE: keep this file pure ASCII. Non-ASCII bytes (CJK comments) are suspected
# to make the Pages _redirects parser drop the whole file, breaking the fallback.
/*    /index.html   200
